<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110269" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντᾰσ-ιόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring images before the mind of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.406
			</span></i>: abs., ib.<i><span class="en">
				397
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in 
				Med.
			, <i>have</i> or <i>form images</i> or
				<i>presentations,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristocl.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				14.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.406
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφαντασιωμένος</span>”
				<i>subject to hallucinations,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					79
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμψυχον φαντασιούμενον</span>
			<i>having the faculty of presentation,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφαντασίωτον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.960d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φαντασιούμενον τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.445
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἡ διάνοια διὰ τῶν αἰσθήσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.72
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.22
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασιωθείς δαιμόνιόν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.236d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.55
			</span></i>, al.</div>
